/*
  ForecastDetails.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0113 · ForecastDetails (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `ForecastDetails` resolves (table "ForecastDetails") lives here with its web value.
  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface
  prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys + values extracted from the web source
  (features/charging/components/cost-analysis/ForecastDetails.tsx), verified against
  web/src/i18n/en.json (costAnalysis.forecast.*). The Home / Supercharger entries
  reproduce the web's bare `t('Home')` / `t('Supercharger')` displayed values. The
  last group backs the native-only chrome (freshness banners, loading / error copy,
  accessibility, and the `/kWh` legend suffix the web renders as a literal).
*/

